This project measures other systems. Where a benchmark methodology follows a
published protocol, the protocol is cited in the code and in
docs/methodology/, so that a reader can check the definition rather than take
this implementation's word for it:

  - Recall by distance threshold follows ANN-Benchmarks
    (Aumüller, Bernhardsson & Faithfull, arXiv:1807.05614).
  - Best-of-N throughput follows the same protocol.
  - Paired significance testing follows Smucker, Allan & Carterette
    (CIKM 2007); confidence intervals follow Urbano et al. (SIGIR 2013).

No trademark of any measured system is claimed. TPC benchmark names are used
only in the form "TPC-H-derived" and never to imply an audited result.
